5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Hello everyone. It is a pleasure to be here. As our household grows, it is only natural that we refine how we share our burdens to ensure everyone feels at peace in their own home.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Servas. It's important that we all feel comfortable. Lately, I've felt that talking about money has become a bit tense, and I'd really like us to find a way to handle this harmoniously.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I agree with Midori. I've heard some people might be paying more than others, and that makes me a little sad. I want us to find a way that is fair for everyone.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"Fairness is great, but let's be real—the current system is a mess. I'm tired of the monthly surprises. We need a plan that doesn't break the bank or cause a headache every single month.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. It would be good to have a clear system. I just hope we can find something that isn't too complicated to manage every month.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is wise to seek clarity. To move forward with a kind heart, we must first understand our history and how others find balance. I suggest we look into the last twelve utility statements and the payment log.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Those sound like good starting points, Servas. I'm also interested in the payment log for the last twelve months. I think seeing the actual history of our payments might help us understand where the friction is coming from.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,I want to know if some people are really paying more. Could we look at the plug-in monitor readings room by room and the sunlight and heating need by room? I think that would be interesting.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"I'm with Minato on the data, but I need the full picture. I'll check the last twelve utility statements to see the seasonal spikes and the electrician's quote to see if changing things is even affordable.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think it would be helpful to see how other people do it. I'll look into the monthly settle observed at another house and the trial run of a reconciliation template.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have a comprehensive plan. By looking at both our own history and external examples, we can find a path that balances precision with the warmth of a shared home.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm glad we're all on the same page. I really hope that by looking at the payment log, we can address the tension and move forward in a way that keeps our friendship first.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I hope the data helps us be kind to each other. If we can see exactly how much energy we use, maybe we can stop worrying and just be happy together.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,Exactly. Let's just make sure we don't get bogged down in the tiny details. I want to see the big numbers and the actual cost of any upgrades before we start dreaming up a perfect system.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope the template makes things easier. I just don't want the person in charge to have to spend too much of their free time on this every month.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Let us proceed with these investigations. May we all look upon the findings not as numbers to argue over, but as tools to build a more considerate and transparent home for us all.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. Let's use this information to create a system where no one feels burdened or accused. I'm looking forward to seeing how we can make our home a more peaceful place for everyone.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'm excited to learn what the monitors show! I hope we can find a way to be fair so that everyone feels happy and no one has to feel sad about the bills.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,"Let's get this over with. I'll take a look at those statements and the quote. I'm expecting some eye-opening numbers, so let's see if we can actually afford to fix this mess.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll go check those things now. I really hope we can find a way to make the monthly process simpler for whoever has to do it.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
