60,3,1,talk,Servas,,Option A invites a spirit of surveillance that may chill our hearts. Option C leaves us vulnerable to the winter's volatility. I believe Option B offers the stability and peace we seek.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Servas. Option A seems too cold and clinical, and Option C keeps the uncertainty that leads to tension. Option B provides a predictable rhythm, which I think will help us avoid those stressful reminders.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Option A seems fair because it shows who uses what, but May said it's too expensive. Option C is easy, but it doesn't help the people in the cold rooms. Is Option B fair for everyone?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,"@Minato, it's the most fair for our wallets. Option A is a financial nightmare with those installation costs, and Option C is just more of the same rollercoaster. Option B actually lets us budget.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think Option C is the simplest, but Option B also seems okay. Option A sounds like it would be a lot of work to track every month, and I really want to avoid that.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, fairness is not always found in a ledger. By agreeing on a seasonal rate, we acknowledge our shared journey through the year, ensuring no one is blindsided by the cold or the cost.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Minato, I think Option B is a kind way to handle this. It removes the shock of high bills, which means we won't have to send those tense reminders that make everyone feel uncomfortable.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"I see. If we use Option B, we won't have to worry about the big spikes. But will the people who use very little electricity still feel like they are paying for others?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, honestly, we all use the shared areas. A few yen difference is nothing compared to the stress of a 30,000 yen bill hitting us in February. Option B is the only one that's actually sustainable.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm worried about the end-of-year settlement in Option B. If we have to calculate all the differences at once, it might be a huge, stressful job for one person. But Option A is definitely too much work.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, a single moment of effort once a year is a small price for twelve months of tranquility. Let us choose the path that fosters generosity and protects our peace.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, I think we can help each other with that final calculation so it doesn't fall on one person. It's a small trade-off to ensure we don't spend the rest of the year feeling tense.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,"I think I understand now. If we all help with the final calculation, it won't be a burden. I want everyone to be happy, so I'll go with Option B too.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,It's settled then. Option B is the only one that stops the winter bills from feeling like a second rent and doesn't require us to bankrupt ourselves on meters. I'm voting for B.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I guess if we all help with the year-end part, it won't be too bad. It's definitely better than Option A. I'll vote for Option B too.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Servas,,"It is a joy to see us reach this consensus. By choosing stability over strictness, we ensure that our home remains a place of warmth and kindness for every soul dwelling here. I vote for Option B.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Midori,,I'm so happy we've found a solution that puts our harmony first. Let's commit to supporting each other during the year-end settle to keep things stress-free. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Minato,,I'm glad we can all agree and be kind to each other. I hope this makes everyone feel fair and happy. I vote for Option B!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,May,,"No more talking in circles. It's practical, it's affordable, and it stops the monthly panic. I'm voting for Option B.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll trust you all to help with the calculations. It's much better than the other options. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
